Rule 2 (chol must be square with positive sizes in its last two dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (rhs must have its M dimension match chol’s M)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1)
>>
Rule 4 (batch dimensions of chol and rhs must match when present)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ (if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i))
>>
Rule 5 (rhs must have a positive K dimension)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) > 0
